@baseUrl = http://localhost:5115

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Upload a Document
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Hello DocVault!
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="tags"

azure,demo
--boundary--

### List All Documents
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/documents

### Get Document By ID (replace with actual id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/REPLACE_WITH_ID

### Delete Document (replace with actual id)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/REPLACE_WITH_ID
